From e0cbd517dc95707e4ab5444d99759696e0b78950 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexandre FILLATRE <alexandre.fillatre@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 12 Apr 2026 23:28:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 061/110] feat(bitbucket): add Bitbucket Cloud integration for
 merge queue (#3600)

* feat(bitbucket): add Bitbucket Cloud integration for merge queue

Add support for merge_strategy=bitbucket in the refinery, enabling
PR-based merging via Bitbucket Cloud REST API 2.0. This brings parity
with the existing GitHub merge_strategy=pr path.

Closes #3599

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

* refactor(refinery): introduce PRProvider interface for VCS-agnostic PR merging

Replace hardcoded GitHub calls in doMergePR with a PRProvider strategy
interface. Add vcs_provider config field ("github" default, "bitbucket")
so merge_strategy=pr remains the strategy while the provider selects
the platform implementation.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

